<title>USA: Buckle Feb same store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Buckle Feb same store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>KEARNEY, Neb. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Buckle Inc said Thursday same store sales for the four-week period ended March 1 rose 7.9 percent from a year ago.</p>
<p>Total sales for the four-week period increased 17.7 percent to $13.4 million from $11.4 million in the corresponding four-week period of fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>Buckle is  a retailer of casual apparel for young men and women, operating 182 retail stores in 22 states.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
